# Place office photos / logos here as {office.slug}.webp (cover) or
# {office.slug}-logo.webp (square logo).
#
# Convention (matches OfficeImage.astro):
# - Logo (1/1): `<office.slug>-logo.webp`, source >= 720×720.
# - Cover (16/9): `<office.slug>.webp`, source >= 1280×720.
# - Until a real file exists, OfficeImage falls back to a deterministic
#   gradient placeholder labelled with the office's initials.
